('body-attachments-snaps-hooks-and-velcro', 'Body Attachments (Snaps, Hooks and Velcro)', 'rifts', 'cybernetics', NULL, 100, '100 credits each; the same to remove.', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Implanted snaps, hooks, tabs, loops, buckles and Velcro for wigs and small items; the best hold 1 lb.', 'Rifts World Book 8: Japan p.111'),
